# Allow a host-prebuilt admin SPA into the build context. The admin build
# runs a self-serving prerender that fails under emulated (Rosetta) docker
# builds, so when dist/client is present the admin-builder stage reuses it
# instead of rebuilding. Native builds (CI, server) have no dist and build
# in-container as usual.
!app/admin/dist
!app/admin/dist/**
